  "title": "Boost Credit Score Today | Debt Freedom",
  "description": "5 Simple Habits To Boost Credit Score.\n\n1. Pay Credit Card On Time — Set up autopay, avoid late fees, and ensure a 35% credit utilization ratio for on-time payments and rewards\n2. Limit Credit Inquiries — Apply for 1-2 loans within 6 months and space out credit applications to minimize hard inquiries and cibil score drops\n3. Check Cibil Report Frequently — Monitor reports for errors, disputing and correcting inaccuracies to maintain a healthy credit score\n4. Maintain Low Debt\n🎵 Half Mystery — \"Half Mystery\" by Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com), Licensed under CC BY 4.0",
